{"tool_name":"using-imagej-to-analyze-the-size,-shape,-and-directionality-of-networks-of-coupled-astrocytes","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p><span><span><span><span>The research goal </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>of </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>this paper was to provide unbiased counts of labeled astrocytes and to estimate the area they cover, further to develop tools for defining the orientation of coupling within astrocyte networks </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>under different stimuli. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span>In order to count the astrocytes and estimate the area they cover the following steps were used in this software. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span>Pre-processing: z-project (using max intensity); split channels; subtract background; remove outliers. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span>Segmentation: adjust threshold and convert to a binary file; Watershed. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span>Cell counting: Analyze particles</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span>Measure Astrocytic network area: select a ROI using the polygon tool; set measurements (area); ROI manager -&gt; add the traced polygon; measure. </span></span></span></span></p>","summary":"","value":"<p><span><span><span><span>The research goal </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>of </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>this paper was to provide unbiased counts of labeled astrocytes and to estimate the area they cover, further to develop tools for defining the orientation of coupling within astrocyte networks </span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>under different stimuli. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span><span><span>In order to count the astrocytes and estimate the area they cover the following steps were used in this software. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span><span><span>Pre-processing: z-project (using max intensity); split channels; subtract background; remove outliers. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span><span><span>Segmentation: adjust threshold and convert to a binary file; Watershed. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span><span><span>Cell counting: Analyze particles</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span><span><span>Measure Astrocytic network area: select a ROI using the polygon tool; set measurements (area); ROI manager -&gt; add the traced polygon; measure. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-24T15:28:24+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-06-21T11:46:00+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[{"cid":null,"comment_count":null,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":null,"last_comment_uid":null,"status":2}],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4295,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"5af16bd3-3619-4ef6-84b9-94d05c673481","url":"/taxonomy/term/4295"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1561119212,"last_comment_uid":19,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Steven Condamine"},{"value":"Dorly Verdier"},{"value":"Arlette Kolta"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":5114,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6af269fd-b28a-4573-a957-15b210c2e34c","url":"/taxonomy/term/5114"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6235419/"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4074,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Feature_extraction","url":"/object-feature-extraction"}],"has_implementation":[